  "summary": "Domain-specific language for programming packet-processing data planes: parsers are state machines that extract headers, control blocks apply match-action tables and actions, and deparsers re-emit packets; the P4_16 core is target-independent while architectures (v1model, PSA, PNA) describe targets.",
